  "literal_question": "On the same fixed c+Z6/sevenreadouts and finite N0 states of totalmass63, can a finite palette of fixed nonzero finite integer kernel moves, with arbitrary translations and signs, connect every observer fiber? No temporarily leaving the fiber, rescaling of occupancy, changed observer or finite coordinate-box assumption.",
