  "bounded_outcome": "At totalmass63, a translation/sign palette connects all observer fibers iff it contains every positiveinteger scale orbit of G_d among its usable moves. In particular no finite fixed palette suffices. This is a direct ordinary COMPOSE consumer of the accepted classification, not a new mathematical mechanism or a claim already peer-reviewed.",
